creatures:
- name: Werebear
  statblock:
    custom_statblock: |
      **Armor Class** 15  
      **Hit Points** 135 (rollable(dice=18d8 + 54,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
      **Speed** Walk 30 ft., Walk 40 ft. (bear form only), Climb 30 ft. (bear form only)  
      **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Initiative) (13)

      ---

      |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
      |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=19)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=11)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=10)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=12)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=17)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=12)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Skills** Perception rollable(dice=1d20+7,label=+7,dicelabel=Perception Check)  
      **Gear** 4x handaxe  
      **Senses** darkvision 60 ft., Passive Perception 17  
      **Languages** Common (can't speak in bear form)  
      **Challenge** 5 (1,800 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +3  

      ## Actions

      ***Multiattack.*** The werebear makes two attacks, using Handaxe or Rend in any combination. It can replace one attack with a Bite attack.

      ***Bite (Bear or Hybrid Form Only).*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+7,label=+7,dicelabel=To Hit [Bite]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=2d12+4,dicelabel=Damage [Bite]) Piercing damage. If the target is a Humanoid, it is subjected to the following effect. *Constitution Saving Throw:* DC 14. *Failure:* The target is cursed. If the cursed target drops to 0 ***Hit Points***, it instead becomes a Werebear under the DM's control and has 10 ***Hit Points***. *Success:* The target is immune to this werebear's curse for 24 hours.

      ***Handaxe (Humanoid or Hybrid Form Only).*** *Melee or Ranged Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+7,label=+7,dicelabel=To Hit [Handaxe]), reach 5 ft or range 20/60 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=3d6+4,dicelabel=Damage [Handaxe]) Slashing damage.

      ***Rend (Bear or Hybrid Form Only).*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+7,label=+7,dicelabel=To Hit [Rend]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=2d8+4,dicelabel=Damage [Rend]) Slashing damage.

      ## Bonus Actions

      ***Shape-Shift.*** The werebear shape-shifts into a Large bear-humanoid hybrid form or a Large bear, or it returns to its true humanoid form. Its game statistics, other than its size, are the same in each form. Any equipment it is wearing or carrying isn't transformed.

    type: custom
  blurb: |
    # $[objectname]

    *Small Medium Monstrosity (Lycanthrope), Neutral Good*  
    **Challenge** 5
  subtype: npc
  id: srd2024werebear
  status: 1

